{#- One sign per day of the week's lunch specials, for the board on the
    wall (client 2026-10-10: read from 6 to 14 feet). Shared by
    sign-day-specials.njk (colour) and sign-day-specials-bw.njk (`bw: true`).

    Each day is its own 11 × 17 portrait page, so the PDF prints the week
    as a stack and any one day can be printed again on its own (print page
    3 for Wednesday). The week is the newest one in specials.json, like the
    weekly post and the counter sign.

    SIZED FOR DISTANCE. About an inch of letter height reads at ten feet,
    so the plate is set at 1.5in (letters about an inch tall) and nothing
    on the sheet is under 0.4in. The sides ("A, B", or "Choice of side") go
    bare: "with" would only cost a line.

    THE SIDES BOX lists the Deli Salads (menu.json), which a customer can
    pick on a choice-of-side day and swap in for the set sides on any
    other (client 2026-10-10), so it says which of the two it is. The soup
    is a separate item, so it has its own box at the foot, with its price. -#}
{%- set week = specials.days | latestWeek %}
{%- set soupCat = (menu.categories | where("id", "soup"))[0] %}
{%- set sidesCat = (menu.categories | where("id", "sides"))[0] %}
{%- set deli = (sidesCat.items | selectattr("choices") | first) if sidesCat else null %}
<div class="ds-stack">
    {%- for d in week %}
    {%- set sides = d | specialSides(true) %}
    <div class="canvas sign ds{% if bw %} sign--bw{% endif %}">
        <header class="ds-top">
            <p class="p-display ds-day ink-accent">{{ d.date | dayDate("weekday") }}</p>
            <p class="ds-date ink-teal">{{ d.date | dayDate("monthDay") }} &middot; lunch special from 11am</p>
        </header>

        <div class="ds-main">
            {#- A name longer than any so far steps down a size, so it still
                fits in two lines. -#}
            <p class="p-display ds-special{% if d.special.length > 24 %} ds-special--long{% endif %} ink-teal">{{ d.special }}</p>
            {%- if sides %}
            <p class="ds-sides">{{ sides }}</p>
            {%- endif %}
            {%- if specials.includesDrink %}
            <p class="ds-drink ink-accent">Includes a drink</p>
            {%- endif %}
        </div>

        {%- if deli %}
        <section class="ds-swap">
            <p class="p-label ds-box-label ink-accent">{% if d.anySide %}Pick your side{% else %}Swap a side for any of these{% endif %}</p>
            <ul class="ds-swap-list">
                {%- for c in deli.choices %}
                <li>{{ c }}</li>
                {%- endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>
        {%- endif %}

        {%- if d.soup %}
        <footer class="ds-soup">
            <p class="p-label ds-box-label ink-accent">Soup of the day</p>
            <div class="ds-soup-row">
                <p class="p-display ds-soup-name ink-teal">{{ d.soup }}</p>
                {%- if soupCat and soupCat.items %}
                <p class="ds-soup-price">{% for s in soupCat.items %}{% if not loop.first %} &middot; {% endif %}{{ s.name }} {{ s.price | money }}{% endfor %}</p>
                {%- endif %}
            </div>
        </footer>
        {%- endif %}
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
</div>
